kY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuTTK4cdOwdtS-gMy0iz07funioDcOMAspzjztNTunh4w&oe=6999A395"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "HOMAE_CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_FINAL1.png", "id": "295243349277898", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/10000000_295243355944564_227383089990940290_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UryGprQ_LQsQ7kNvwEU9tq2&_nc_oc=AdmZkYrNEzWCcIr-IglyxwwQ1Dd297CvROxK4UB9zbanNHNSmPcGbIU_f4BefjbChVE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftbvqnjzvp7FkNmSwESToS6vz7dgWxgFGdQ9tHh9R-qqw&oe=69999486"}, "display_name": "Hoame", "keywords": ["meditation", "fitness", "yoga", "sports", "relaxation"], "long_description": "Introducing the world\u2019s first virtual meditation studio!\n \nTap into the power of a real boutique meditation studio from the comfort of your own home. Experience the feeling of presence by dropping into a studio class or unplug with an elevated meditation experience from our on-demand library.\n\nGo deep with our diverse group of expert instructors who will take any intimidation out of meditation. With our vast roster, and over 15+ styles of meditation, there is a mindfulness practice for everyone.\n\nOur goal is to help you unlock your full potential.\n\nMembership Includes:\n\n\u00b7       Daily studio classes\n\u00b7       Growing library of on demand experiences\n\u00b7       Breathwork practice\n\u00b7       Monthly events & workshops\n\u00b7       Expert instructors\n\u00b7       Real studio community\n\u00b7       Progress tracker \n\u00b7       Mood surveys\n\u00b7       Sit-set customizer\n\u00b7       7-day free trial  \n \nChoose the plan that is best for you and start today.\n\nSee you on the cushion!", "short_description": "Introducing the world\u2019s first virtual meditation studio!\n \nTap into the power of a real boutique meditation studio from the comfort of your own home. Experience the feeling of presence by 